ience. Whether you&#8217;re planning a wedding, mitzvah, corporate event, or school dance, DJ Catscratch is ready to make your event unforgettable with his seasoned expertise and infectious energy.<\/p>\n<div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Vish B, better known as DJ Catscratch, has been setting the vibe since 2002, bringing a rich history of DJing to every event he touches. Born in Queens, NY, Vish was introduced to the art of DJing at a young age, following in the footsteps of his father, who was also a DJ. This early&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-18691","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.7 (Yoast SEO v26.7) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Vish B - JAMMIN&#039; DJs Georgia &amp; Tennessee<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/vish-b\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Vish B\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Vish B, better known as DJ Catscratch, has been setting the vibe since 2002, bringing a rich history of DJing to every event he touches. Born in Queens, NY, Vish was introduced to the art of DJing at a young age, following in the footsteps of his father, who was also a DJ. This early&hellip;\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/vish-b\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"JAMMIN&#039; DJs Georgia &amp; Tennessee\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jammindjs\" \/>\n<meta property=\"articl